    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d5">

                <pb facs="0086" n="4" sameAs="frus:frus1945Malta/pg4"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to Marshal Stalin </hi><anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d5-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<hi rendition="#small-caps">Pearl Harbor,
                            Hawaii</hi>,] <lb/>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1944-07-27">27 July 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Number 32. Top Secret and Personal. For Marshal Stalin from the President.</p>
                <pb facs="0087" n="5" xml:id="pg5"/>
                <p>I can fully understand the difficulty of your coming to a conference with the
                    Prime Minister and me in view of the rapid military progress now being made but
                    I hope you can keep such a conference very much in mind and that we can meet as
                    early as possible. Such a meeting would help me domestically and we are
                    approaching the time for further strategical decisions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d5-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d5-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the United States Naval Attaché, Moscow, via Navy channels.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
